'''Rare Atom''' is a [[:Category:China|Chinese]] esports organization based in Shanghai, China.

==Timeline==
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2022
|name2=2023
|name3=2024
|name4=2025
|name5=2026
|This=5

|content1=
* January 30th - '''Rare Atom''' is formed with the acquisition of [[ViCi Gaming]]<nowiki>'</nowiki>s ''CS:GO'' division. <ref name="ra transfer">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/rare_atom/status/1487660678286659589|title=We are excited to announce @VICI CS:GO division rebranded to RA CS:GO division|author='''Rare Atom'''|date=2022-01-30}}</ref>
*Febuary 19th - [[zhokiNg]] is acquired by [[YK Gaming]]. <ref name="zhoking leaves">{{cite web|url=https://csgo.com.hk/2022/03/01/freeman-marek-zhoking-leads-the-yk-gaming/news/latest/|date=2022-03-01|title=Freeman Marek ZhokiNg領銜 YK Gaming成立|trans_title=Feature with Freeman, Marek, ZhokiNg  YK Gaming launched official|language={{Flag|hk}} Traditional Chinese|author=[[LemonFox]]|publisher=[[TomorrowLAN]]}}</ref>
*December 12th - '''Rare Atom''' part ways with [[aumaN]]. <ref name="-aumaN">{{cite web|url=https://weibo.com/7736530902/MjgO6o2z7|title=经过与选手的反复沟通及协商，在充分尊重选手本人意愿的前提下，原RA_CSGO分部选手刘治宏（ID：aumaN）即日起正式离队|trans_title=After repeated communication and negotiation with the players, and on the premise of fully respecting the wishes of the players themselves, former RA_CSGO player Liu Zhihong (ID: aumaN) will officially leave the team with immediate effect|language={{flag|cn}} Simplified Chinese|date=2022-12-12|author='''Rare Atom'''}}</ref>

|content2=
* August 7th - '''Rare Atom''' part ways with their lineup following the expiration of their contracts. <ref name="disband aug23">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/rare_atom/status/1688369367656906752|title=About Our CSGO Team Roster Change, please read our announcement picture below for details|date=2023-08-07|author='''Rare Atom'''}}</ref>
* September 14th - '''Rare Atom''' acquire [[Twista]] from [[JANO Esports]] as coach and sign [[peku]] as an assistant coach and analyst. <ref name="finland">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/rare_atom/status/1702267264773542074|title=Today we are happy and proud to announce the addition of @TwistaCSGO and @pekuCS to our CS:GO lineup as head coach and assistant coach/analyst|date=2023-09-14|author='''Rare Atom'''}}</ref>
* October 10th - '''Rare Atom''' assemble a new roster consisting of [[somebody]] and [[Summer]], on loan and acquired from [[TYLOO]], respectively, alongside [[EXPRO]], [[kory]], and [[phzy]]. <ref name="+team">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/rare_atom/status/1711592815099334820|title=RARE ATOM CS2 TEAM NEW ROSTER ANNOUNCENTMENT|date=2023-10-10|author='''Rare Atom'''}}</ref><ref name="somebody loan RA">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/tyloogaming/status/1711709097832464863|title=Good luck to SOMEBODY and Summer|date=2023-10-10|author=[[TYLOO]]}}</ref>
* December 31st - '''Rare Atom''' sign [[somebody]] on a permanent basis following the end of his contract with [[TYLOO]]. <ref name="somebody fa">{{inside source}}</ref>

|content3=
* March 29th - '''Rare Atom''' part ways with [[EXPRO]], [[kory]], [[phzy]], [[Twista]] and [[peku]]. <ref name="-eu">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/rare_atom/status/1773590913639673880|title=Today we're announcing changes to our CS lineup|date=2024-03-29|author='''Rare Atom'''}}</ref>
* April 8th - '''Rare Atom''' acquire [[L1haNg]] from [[NewHappy]] and sign [[ChildKing]], [[Risk (Chinese player)|risk]], and [[z8z]], the latter as coach. <ref name="2024 ra">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/rare_atom/status/1777336939651469673|title=Today we are happy and proud to announce the addition of 4 new faces  to our CS2 Lineup, and now our full lineup is|date=2024-04-08|author='''Rare Atom'''}}</ref>
* June 26th - '''Rare Atom''' bench [[Risk (Chinese player)|risk]] and sign [[kaze]] as his replacement. <ref name="+kaze -risk">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/rare_atom/status/1805926804194255159|title=Today we are happy and proud to announce the new but familiar face to our CS2 lineup|date=2024-06-26|author='''Rare Atom'''}}</ref>
* July 5th - [[Risk (Chinese player)|risk]] leaves '''Rare Atom''' following the expiration of his contract. <ref name="risk leave">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/rare_atom/status/1809120028769538504|title=Goodbye R1sk, thanks everything you did for RACS2|date=2024-07-05|author='''Rare Atom'''}}</ref>

|content4=
