* August 1st - '''Rare Atom''' bench [[Trash]]. <ref name="trash benched">{{cite web|url=https://www.bilibili.com/opus/1096083844478533653|title=BLAST Bounty S2 RA CS分部大名单|trans_title=BLAST Bounty Season 2 Rare Atom Counter-Strike Roster|language={{flag|cn}} Simplified Chinese|author='''Rare Atom'''|date=2025-08-01}}</ref>
