*December 1st - '''SINNERS Esports''' sign [[oskar]]. <ref name="oskar">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/sinnersesports/posts/456408269086366|title=Tomáš "Oskar" Šťastný is a Sinner!|date=2020-12-01|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>

|content2=
*January 8th - '''SINNERS Esports''' part ways with [[Dukkha]]. <ref name="-Dukkha">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Dukkhacs/status/1347644406002810883|title=Not Sinning anymore if any team needs a coach/analyst then don't hesitate to contact me|date=2021-01-08|author=[[Dukkha]]}}</ref>
*January 22nd - [[CaNNiE]] departs '''SINNERS Esports''' as he retires from competitive ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]''. <ref name="-CaNNiE">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/canniecsgo/posts/1079726909209158|title=Moje kariéra profesionálního CS:GO hráče je dnešním dnem oficiálně u konce|language={{Flag|cz}} Czech|trans_title=My career as a professional CS:GO player is officially done as of today|date=2021-01-22|author=[[CaNNiE]]}}</ref>
