*June 1st - '''SINNERS Esports''' sign [[tomkeejs]] as coach. <ref name="+tomkeejs">{{cite web|url=https://sinners.gg/article.asp?id=tomkeejs-takes-over-the-CS-GO-team-as-a-coach-76|title=tomkeejs takes over the CS:GO team as a coach|date=2021-06-01|publisher='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>

|content3=
*January 12th - [[oskar]] is acquired by an undisclosed team. '''SINNERS Esports''' acquire [[forsyy]] from [[ENTERPRISE esports]] to complete the roster. <ref name="-oskar">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/1481191344236371970|title=Thank you for everything, @CSGOoskar|date=2022-01-12|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref><ref name="+forsyy">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/sinners_esports/status/1481212035392327681|title=Welcome to SINNERS Esports, @forsyy_|date=2022-01-12|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
*May 27th - [[NEOFRAG]] is acquired by [[OG]]. <ref name="-NEO">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/1530171967889756160|title=Today marks the last day of @neofragcs wearing our jersey|date=2022-05-27|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
*July 15th - '''SINNERS Esports''' acquire [[Zero]] from [[Team GamerLegion]]. <ref name="+Zero">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/1547928984465309696|title=The only Zero we take and appreciate|date=2022-07-15|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
*November 23rd - '''SINNERS Esports''' bench and transfer-list [[forsyy]] and re-sign [[oskar]]. <ref name="forsyy tf">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/1595386680743104512|title=What a year it has been|date=2022-11-23|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref><ref name="+oskar2">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/1595401783853035527|title=He's back|date=2022-11-23|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>

|content4=
*February 24th - '''SINNERS Esports''' promote [[outex]] on trial from their [[SINNERS Academy|academy team]] as [[Zero]] steps down from the roster due to personal reasons. <ref name="+outex">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/1629085185072414721|title=#SINCSGO roster update|date=2023-02-24|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
*March 17th - '''SINNERS Esports''' demote [[outex]] to their [[SINNERS Academy|academy team]] and add [[KWERTZZ]] on trial. <ref name="-outex +KWERTZ">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/1636720311100928000|title=With this tournament, @kwt_cs will begin his trial period with the #SINCSGO team|date=2023-03-17|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
*March 20th - [[Zero]] departs '''SINNERS Esports''' as he retires from competitive ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]''. <ref name="-Zero">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/1637793670899351560|title=Today with a heavy heart we would like to announce that @PatrikZero has decided to retire as a professional CS:GO player|date=2023-03-20|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
*March 22nd - '''SINNERS Esports''' sign [[KWERTZZ]] on a permanent basis. <ref name="+KWERTZ">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/1638556259472273410|title=You’ve already seen him in action with the #SINCSGO boys, now it’s time to make it official|date=2023-03-22|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
*July 5th - [[forsyy]] is acquired by [[Entropiq]]. <ref name="-forsyy">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/1676637075993493509|title=As of today our boy @forsyy_ is officially no longer a part of SINNERS Esports|date=2023-07-05|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
*December 13th - '''SINNERS Esports''' bench [[KWERTZZ]]. <ref name="KWERTZZ bench">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/1734981762885808166|title=As of today, we’re saying goodbye to the one and only, @kwt_cs|date=2023-12-13|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
*December 15th - '''SINNERS Esports''' re-sign [[NEOFRAG]] and acquire [[AJTT]] from [[Sprout Academy]]. Additionally, [[ZEDKO]] is acquired by [[Team Sampi]]. <ref name="+NEOFRAG +AJTT">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/1735691191759311065|title=Putting SINNERS back on the map|date=2023-12-15|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref><ref name="-ZEDKO">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/1735645912502809041|title=Undisputed 5-time MČR champion, an amazing player and a great friend|date=2023-12-15|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
*December 31st - '''SINNERS Esports''' release [[KWERTZZ]] upon the expiration of his contract. <ref name="-KWERTZZ">{{inside source|date=2023-12-13|source=SINNERS}}</ref>

|content5=
*May 13th - '''SINNNERS Esports''' bench [[NEOFRAG]] and promote [[majky]] from [[SINNERS Academy]] on a trial basis. <ref name="neofrag bench">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/1790048317927268739|title=#SINCS2 roster update|date=2024-05-13|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
*June 16th - '''SINNNERS Esports''' bench [[AJTT]] and add [[MoriiSko]] on a trial basis. <ref name="ajtt bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/1802345220966596789|title=#SINCS2 roster update|date=2024-06-16|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
*July 16th - '''SINNNERS Esports''' release [[NEOFRAG]] by mutual agreement. <ref name="-NEOFRAG">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/neofragcs/status/1813213366795608225|title=As of today I’m officially a FREE AGENT after mutual termination of the contract with @SINNERS_Esports|date=2024-07-16|author=[[NEOFRAG]]}}</ref>
*July 29th - '''SINNERS Esports''' sign [[majky]] and [[MoriiSko]] on a permanent basis. <ref name="+majky +moriisko">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/1817929836062765469|title=Surprise surprise|date=2024-07-29|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
*August 8th - '''SINNERS Esports''' release [[AJTT]] upon the expiration of his contract. <ref name="-AJT">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/1821489639267385836|title=As of today, we’re officially parting ways with @Ajtt_cs  as his contract expires|date=2024-08-08|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
*December 30th - [[beastik]] signs a contract extension with '''SINNERS Esports''', keeping him tied to the organization for 2025. <ref>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/1873692944915661017|title=Another year with beast(ik)|date=2024-12-30|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
*December 31st - '''SINNERS Esports''' bench [[majky]] and part ways with [[tomkeejs]]. <ref name="majky bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/1874113674119684424|title=As of today, we are moving @majkycs & @tomkejs1 to the inactive roster|date=2024-12-31|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref><ref name="-tomkeejs">{{inside source|date=2026-07-14|source=SINNERS}}</ref>

|content6=
*January 6th - [[oskar]] is acquired by an undisclosed organization, later releaved to be [[Inner Circle Esports]]. <ref name="-oskar2">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/sinners_esports/status/1876324389035155552|title=A legend, an amazing friend, the GOAT, one of a kind|date=2025-01-06|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
*January 7th - '''SINNERS Esports''' sign [[ZEDKO]], [[Pepo]], and [[bfull]], the latter as coach. <ref name="Roster 2025">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/1876584856534303209|title=Ready to fuck shit up|date=2025-01-07|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
