*June 30th - '''SINNERS Esports''' bench [[MoriiSko]] and [[ZEDKO]]. <ref name="bench duo">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/1939730730042454484|title=#SINCS2 roster update|date=2025-06-30|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
*July 21st - '''SINNERS Esports''' sign [[kisserek]] and [[stressarN]]. <ref name="+kisserek +stressarN">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/1947295600031965186|title=SINNERS ARE GOING INTERNATIONAL!|date=2025-07-21|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
*August 14th - [[MoriiSko]] is acquired by [[UNiTY esports]]. <ref name="-MoriiSko">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/1956056884676362243|title=As of today, we officially confirm the transfer of @CSMoriiSko from our inactive roster to @UNiTYesports_eu|date=2025-08-14|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
*December 27th - '''SINNERS Esports''' bench [[Pepo]]. <ref name="pepo bench">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/2004990705966489684|title=From an academy stand-in to a triple LAN champion and a top 40 team player in less than one year|date=2025-12-27|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>

|content7=
*January 2nd - '''SINNERS Esports''' sign [[MoDo]]. <ref name="+modo">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/2007070729477734478|title=It's time to put SINNERS back on the map|date=2026-01-02|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
*January 26th - '''SINNERS Esports''' release [[ZEDKO]]. <ref name="-ZEDKO 2026">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/2015801932628029823|title=The legend, OG member of SINNERS, a real one from day one|date=2026-01-26|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
*March 5th - '''SINNERS Esports''' release [[Pepo]]. <ref name="pepo fa">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/SINNERS_Esports/status/2029633855125131379|title=As of today, @PepoCS2's contract has ended and becomes a free agent|date=2026-03-05|author='''SINNERS Esports'''}}</ref>
